ose, cheese plate, and an order of fried chickpeas. All were great! I could eat those chickpeas for days! Our server was friendly and not overbearing, which I always appreciate. I would definitely like to go back for dinner one night. The ambiance of Meauxbar is very cool and laid back; makes for a good date spot."},{"business_id":"d5IbvRTwnvmaHg_wiq0XrQ","review_id":"qAwkAmG1qcoGKUJUfJLt5Q","date":"2018-09-04T16:56:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9377503991127014,"text_excerpt":"Parking was a breeze in the evening - I'm sure if there's an event going on in the area it'd be a lot harder to park. The ambiance was very enjoyable; even with a large table seated not far we could easily hear each other and enjoy a nice dinner. The service was great, from the host station to wait staff and bartender, everyone was on point. The food was on point as well as the drinks. Definitely a place I would happily frequent if we lived closer. The cocktails are very interesting, original, and well made - we enjoyed Rose Vermouth & Tequila, but the Pastis is my favorite! Our first round of drinks we ordered the duck fat popcorn, which is almost better than duck fat fries - you get a h..."},{"business_id":"d5IbvRTwnvmaHg_wiq0XrQ","review_id":"1UyVSuA12hJlip-8AazjDQ","date":"2019-12-27T17:26:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9354672431945801,"text_excerpt":"This place is AMAZING. We worked down the list of cocktails and everything we ordered food wise was amazing. I got deviled eggs and cheese because the cocktails were my main game. But my date tried the pork dish and loved it. And we split octopus which was such a good idea - not stingy portions at all. The servers are super knowledgeable about everything and the ambience is unparalleled really. Super romantic."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"d5IbvRTwnvmaHg_wiq0XrQ","photo_id":"A_X1xxd8DyuiviBxFWitvA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/A_X1xxd8DyuiviBxFWitvA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8933539986610413},{"busine